# Varesa Columbina Sara Xianyun. ~26s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Varesa Lunarcharge. 2 sets of 4 plunges separated by Sara's buffs and Xianyun's VV refresh with 2 skills per rotation.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
